{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000012_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000012_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:234033cbb348142366c051ad775aa55214fb8332083f82909a33a6f56f31b9f4", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 1, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "……", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000013_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000013_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:93e9d6021e88a8a534a34f6b7ecc2640eafa6596ce6dbbf50f70b727fc6c6e94", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 2, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я приподнимаюсь на футоне и рассеянно греюсь в свежих лучах утреннего солнца.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000014_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000014_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:01aa12adc9ce8a0901b66e6bead3f08e3b962b92654e141da89c229c9f91f2c6", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 3, "speaker": null, "translation": "И снова и снова прокручиваю в голове вчерашний сон.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000015_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000015_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:70dd2a6ade1b47b320815ab5083beadc352e8b07fe416d77090768bbb3213ab9", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 4, "speaker": null, "translation": "Особенно ту его часть, где была Номики.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000016_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000016_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bff0223ca4e811b9ccb346f11ecc2edd909769e5a2061d27968a565bee9e43cb", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 5, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "……", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000017_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000017_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5a8aa5594e4b91deb11bc67156aedb7202febeaf9586ec1a2bf15fd5c364cd82", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 6, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Дорогой.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000020_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000020_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1434c82a923d79c33a06b2c53d29971134f6210731f3a8d81060e5a6993cc20c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 7, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а!!!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000021_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000021_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7be4c74466d46eb842c750fe0e6fd37ebd9e86a93e8e46bfd77edd3c90bdd13b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 8, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я хватаюсь за голову и корчусь.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000022_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000022_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:666ba59b3f65f738d33c851cb7fd05ff11154025ed790eb48e3f0c55a8782b3c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 9, "speaker": null, "translation": "Но тут же спохватываюсь и смотрю на фусуму.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000023_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000023_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e8200259063c9b2ae3f53dece784cbd590cf3fbb19e9e3a77998389c157618df", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 10, "speaker": null, "translation": "Щели нет.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000024_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000024_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8a5dfdee518fdf2aa195c1e5a4deb92c5186229dc802388364e7ec3f73d17d92", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 11, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Фух…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000025_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000025_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0906aec99c63d094cf1b4106a87ca4c545e91bd8d6ec5d91e80ea228797eb53a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 12, "speaker": null, "translation": "Сегодня за мной не подглядывали.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000028_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000028_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:50b1927f084582da773e8c307e1a5e3c4f02979a3eceae6504ae703f36d77e61", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 13, "speaker": "鏡子", "translation": "Хи-хи, молодость.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000029_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000029_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e419e8ebb588df8609bc5cb6ca4b5274c66cdd0a74a81e748a0c933dae6c9718", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 14, "speaker": null, "translation": "Из-за фусумы доносится один лишь голос.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000030_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000030_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:00859d676f5372721e3c0d78c1abcc7d2f833b01b09d891b3f0777365d2696dd", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 15, "speaker": null, "translation": "Похоже, всё-таки подглядывали.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000031_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000031_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cffefb891f02bdc01d21e99a2c265deefb596eb534115ed076fdb0132e8ca4fe", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 16, "speaker": null, "translation": "Эх… Кажется, с каждым днём я всё больше опускаюсь.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000032_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000032_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a93c829c7b75e08c29c1d279fc1cb8b57f688f2ed2b47561943d4c89c5f155e4", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 17, "speaker": null, "translation": "Даже если я постоянно думаю о Номики, зачем мне видеть её во сне несколько ночей подряд?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000033_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000033_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1844916c137a0b602e3a2031611f952e8b45e7dc530190ed3d5071d1f119ab58", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 18, "speaker": null, "translation": "И каждый сон как на заказ — всё в мою пользу.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000034_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000034_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c521ef959088817d32fec28ab2049686e74f56e2958bff657bee8aa87ac3c97b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 19, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Дорогой…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000037_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000037_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d2341526d18fcd3b855a68a1870966161e6dfb31e541c2f2bd9ba29e102155a0", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 20, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а-а!!!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000038_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000038_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:861ed7fa7122559507429b63bcada29e445752b1241029548db25fd3b70c438b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 21, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я снова хватаюсь за голову и корчусь.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000039_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000039_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5c61de1c923f5b4e134b20a70c7f7adfa9df4e545b5a22cd5a9722bbe3c9ec83", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 22, "speaker": null, "translation": "Как бы сильно она мне ни нравилась, прежде мне ещё ни разу не снилась одна и та же девушка несколько ночей подряд.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000040_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000040_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a4316b743d25a09a44ab5f84b8647c0af6b4b4ded9248df24645c25fa0f35e95", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 23, "speaker": null, "translation": "До какой же степени я успел влюбиться в Номики…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000059_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000059_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:40d8e63a49cca94b2ad40085b4d8beed0e2592f466abc707ac684458663c419e", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 24, "speaker": null, "translation": "Но даже с этими мыслями я отправляюсь на обход вместе с исполнительным отделом.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000070_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000070_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e7b5cc2b463464124dce9c75c7326e7657ce5d8a7bd145040031fb306f5b15a5", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 25, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "И сегодня на острове спокойно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000073_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000073_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:43aea2e280cb50e29f97c271654ca7f3703fab1f6571c7d13a5680423b4cbd5c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 26, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хорошо бы и люди извне смогли почувствовать эту безмятежную атмосферу.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000074_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000074_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:28accddaef6849318510f8124f6cf072e6629eee35f0cb973e8d7e4afe1aa69c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 27, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "……", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000075_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000075_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:64c831dcb3898dbb7e0425465cf73a8b53ef1264a87cc0795b774e35501c00b2", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 28, "speaker": null, "translation": "Всё из-за того сна. Я не могу отвести от Номики глаз.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000076_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000076_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:a73d063fb7a70e3c38c2b69af645f55195412ee2f3cfa399ee9c99c08f7e00b5", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 29, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Ангел.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000079_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000079_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bf9155278434531aa96395e9107b8176f1e7b5755ab94c0e4a77b50e0093213f", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 30, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "М? Ты что-то сказал?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000080_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000080_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9a189ea3c3a142a2a3da60ab21134539c7bf94f9a5ee499e709977850e4bdd47", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 31, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Нет! Ничего я не говорил!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000083_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000083_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:87e5f50a9920725fe30a498b35f08aee972061453d2cf90571d7524a7166bb2f", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 32, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Вот как?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000084_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000084_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:16a692db3aa79c039224085bbe6ecd41b410adcbebba896a8e6103bc4b00f7c7", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 33, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Ага, именно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000087_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000087_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:dd99b670c13ddfbf42b9867071633d99d9ac2ec1d4af75a373b37e002dc70ace", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 34, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Хм…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000090_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000090_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2f0bbe53194579d59fac00ac1768cba34e1bb439d72bc6dab8e46f3ba1b6f6a0", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 35, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Такахара, у тебя недавно что-то случилось?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000093_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000093_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b7a2a9d58591ce14a822b2b00a4a98c5acf87000fbec247cd88e788cfbae4f9a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 36, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Ты в последнее время сам не свой.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000094_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000094_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e71775666216f17b58b2477ff37620c48ddbb8bb8fd916441a4f34e42ff97c54", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 37, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Я всегда странно себя веду.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000097_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000097_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4cce263db7f20313ea1daeb69432c496997242cd3d6ce412115fcc371c422457", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 38, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Это верно, но…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000098_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000098_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9036abfbdecf9204eff4fb897ac861719f458fd6998e52d43a0d49dd56f5d9d7", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 39, "speaker": null, "translation": "Вот тут хотелось бы услышать возражение.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000101_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000101_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:61a5690e9042a4d7f47e5d19b618e4f401ceae12667d7e90c0be887efb8234d6", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 40, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Если тебя что-то тревожит, я хотя бы выслушаю тебя.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000102_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000102_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8dcab85042700fab6f383f6cff04afebf3acf3183d26e73fb222ec388b88a83b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 41, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да нет, ничего такого меня не тревожит…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000105_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000105_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b0298e47352f900df682af1e2c682f4af0620b1581306e969bf806cc1bc0d474", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 42, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Вот как? Тогда хорошо…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000108_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000108_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:2f8d24381f22730d5544a01a4a12d3b5893283f8722470ddca780605bf8ca376", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 43, "speaker": null, "translation": "Ещё вчера я хотел признаться ей, но из-за сна меня мучает какое-то странное чувство вины, и слова не идут.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000109_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000109_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:89d902e10ec684f7f9097eef6a121dca98a8ab942e81ff1fad4d2ba3fb4743fc", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 44, "speaker": null, "translation": "И к тому же…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000110_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000110_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:609b48d247ad3f6706ce1e9160734aba0f954747b1072d88d4beb93eafecd2f6", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 45, "speaker": null, "translation": "Вчера казалось, что Номики тоже стала смотреть на меня иначе, а сегодня снова ведёт себя как обычно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000111_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000111_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ef5b5c1a988b1e0ca9887f23d7d906ae2d97bfcfc8476fa46c3d214145e46674", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 46, "speaker": null, "translation": "Это сбивает меня с толку ещё сильнее.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000112_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000112_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9713203429566769b5ecc9a4bed52aa188fe2978b41210d461eb917ca6562a70", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 47, "speaker": null, "translation": "Хотя если бы вчерашняя неловкость так и не прошла, тоже было бы тяжело.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000115_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000115_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0105df6bebf06d6cfa5d6159f015556e5dffe7c449915353ed4798a851024ff8", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 48, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Раз с тобой всё хорошо, можно попросить тебя об одолжении?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000116_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000116_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7f946d4f052921fe7a0da8c75b5acbc2355671f263c0ec88eb0ace0fa947efc8", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 49, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "А? Да, конечно, если это мне по силам.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000119_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000119_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ddb3cc83b162d212227efe58ecd2f8c41c5dd49b642d61b61669d237a00eee2b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 50, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Отлично, это очень поможет.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000122_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000122_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:f17302d16ad5caf988a334fa2ad3d2b0636927356b58f8d669719c5d79883a4a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 51, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Дело в том, что скоро молодёжный отряд будет проводить одно мероприятие.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000123_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000123_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1ca903213da9f324ac08a38cfc6e620fdb55e6551e149a1eb4e0358afe95299f", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 52, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Мероприятие молодёжного отряда?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000126_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000126_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c97d7e3a33eb18ee2609e34ccdf67ebed1e0a075bf06e5fcbd078a4eb3d01d73", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 53, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Да. Но мы организаторы, так что не участвуем сами, а работаем за кулисами.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000129_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000129_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:db0eed97cb7f3208beb7bf1f78cfd93a8408c6f73efaf6b2a0a381006a3fdede", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 54, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Вообще-то ты гость на острове, и тебе следовало бы участвовать и веселиться, но…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000130_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000130_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:1a5d4ce81731c697c94033480d3c58e6fd38ea7971cf4d5f60e7e29f79fbef21", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 55, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да нет, быть организатором тоже интересно. Я совсем не против.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000133_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000133_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:165346f7a8b95048306c0c6fc5c2d0093f25020ef31aa3fec55c35ba63256df2", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 56, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Вот как. Тогда можно попросить и тебя помочь?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000134_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000134_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d37bcf174fd0a0e3a12a89a72a6fb77dfc4858adee3b0a5aead3295df6fbf774", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 57, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Конечно. Пусть временно, но сейчас я тоже член молодёжного отряда.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000135_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000135_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:891873f10a2702c6f1072a1af394e682d705654ed8b13cfb073634c761a927c2", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 58, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Я сделаю всё, чтобы мероприятие прошло на ура.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000138_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000138_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:c44331f6e4da5d46e979a0323b8effacac8abd397cf92b37410e01f56644452c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 59, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "На тебя можно положиться.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000141_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000141_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:63360818a4a641be2199ed9f7aea098672f9d8f12fc56a9b972dc86d0d1c72e9", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 60, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Уверена, в работе организатора тоже есть своя радость.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000144_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000144_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:03743e509e7601e3ef904bf52ead20987622aceffc441993508344c7952926a1", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 61, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Поэтому я хочу, чтобы ты всё равно хорошо провёл время, пусть и по-другому.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000145_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000145_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ff95cda034927ed304835810028f6ea913dedc3fcccdd38ca4f0e1634ca2dbf3", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 62, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Одних этих слов хватит, чтобы я работал усерднее всех.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000148_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000148_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d0b73eaf789d82e104b1c277a717df49d3d6ce86f3ca2d2c10619dae7fb54a46", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 63, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Да, рассчитываю на тебя.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000149_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000149_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3cb3334d28c898cec3e6d5d0bb744f3c986afb13df5f992f6ebfaf739fef60f1", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 64, "speaker": null, "translation": "Рядом с Номики мне наверняка будет весело чем бы мы ни занимались.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000150_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000150_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5b753a8eaf47e4d2bb3559d6ce595b7ecf356cde1c5a20e993dcf5f74ceff4d8", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 65, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Так что это за мероприятие?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000153_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000153_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:79e027c57ecbc4f3eb8f3513858fc5281d36a3795b97eea8e81e6f957d323e97", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 66, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Испытание храбрости.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000154_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000154_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:5a544aefff3646cb2af9fc7523f58c8c5453ea44f87133d9505b4a1d93a46058", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 67, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Понятно. Летняя классика.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000157_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000157_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:79806e57ce9edcb0e6e49c49959b4b197cc852d28f23f288e3c95e7f2e0a9467", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 68, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Да, мы проводим его каждый год.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000158_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000158_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e5d0b4b296bfaef54ffaea74a739879f139eb545b0de4dececefb7cd82680dcc", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 69, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Раз мы за кулисами, значит, будем пугать участников?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000161_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000161_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ca5c0cf440d90e1fcf4509ee905231d475892b5fdb8307b3ba0ce4ebcbf0d260", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 70, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Угу.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000162_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000162_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:09ed47a9a1885fb6d22ffb142cdea7f8cc5257ce143c475b86ee36fb7b03f0be", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 71, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "По части испытаний храбрости я в себе уверен.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000165_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000165_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4162812b765afd67ef88aaa46330c601bb9d0638435982967156292253117795", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 72, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Редкое умение.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000166_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000166_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3720bc2cf609d7f68394fa7c74a5c487463b5f8b661ad954b2b157d9fed08581", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 73, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Да…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000167_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000167_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:fa0329bfe81a8ceef66f7f9d1102292d82a41f570652e010d6fc6991d6a775d3", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 74, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я вспоминаю родные края.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000193_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000193_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:78cc904203465cf1634148de2f76d26aae1a6b838ff23012745e2401fa688bd3", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 75, "speaker": null, "translation": "Да, это было в последнее лето средней школы…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000194_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000194_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:85b9135f5c217cc4ae652f98016e7c13e75557d5571436a7483ebee05a6aaf44", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 76, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "Говорят, есть законный способ оказаться вплотную к девушке.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000195_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000195_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:d85acd1572f4e38f666d9dee81e425d32616ddcf665fe15a77dbfe2558396ef8", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 77, "speaker": "中学時代の友人B", "translation": "Серьёзно? Такое вообще возможно?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000196_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000196_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cee3f9abcc4b789756f414c1375c7f848550b836128d1a22e24e6f05003e22e5", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 78, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "Испытание храбрости.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000197_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000197_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:80b077340ead33615ce33044b27c6baaf9470961c4e70c50ba8907b0a2550cfa", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 79, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Понятно. Испуганная девушка обнимет того, кто рядом.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000198_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000198_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:3d556bbf978f0e7e81984c2052f8b068987fab26a5d65b92b78d39d80135b567", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 80, "speaker": "中学時代の友人B", "translation": "Точно! Законные объятия!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000199_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000199_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:75c762865f07346264849ad87a86e5a5a7ac3cb3e326ee6e809b530176aac3f0", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 81, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "Но для этого нужно соблюсти одно важное условие.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000200_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000200_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8182402102822a91863330dcc599c375bc9c62e5787c1aa0496a2b37f3239e5c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 82, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Что? Правильно выбрать место для испытания?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000201_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000201_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:b1adedcb3fa26976ae485614fb5c3c5d7cb415408b0a0e68190376230827c2d5", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 83, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "Мы, парни, не должны испугаться.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000202_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000202_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6dea21ff580de27ff2ade05ae81673bd781cf4fb4c7ce77a3425c4df09944a3f", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 84, "speaker": "中学時代の友人B", "translation": "Точно! Логично!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000203_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000203_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:fc689953ec1b6c7e2c277afb7937c5f517d165817ca77abb73382f9ea054d4c0", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 85, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Значит, нам нужно обрести железную волю, которая не дрогнет ни при каких обстоятельствах.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000204_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000204_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:4c007e6f36bfebe820219792c3c2f49e6b13bcc055215c0ea35b9b4fa19dbef3", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 86, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "В итоге да, но есть способ попроще.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000205_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000205_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9e4e87b46612e39c5e72d5135c961bab8f3b52dde19260a3825d47a35fced32c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 87, "speaker": "中学時代の友人B", "translation": "Расскажи! Прошу!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000206_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000206_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:be46d0f1dddd760da42d80055d860a2d391ee3b4d5c1e9767b9be977b89df10c", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 88, "speaker": "中学時代の友人A", "translation": "Надо заранее знать все места, где участников будут пугать.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000207_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000207_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:31710803e595ecc7895d70dda582245531d9200254c75dd3b3a5c492711ede2a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 89, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Понятно… Если знаешь, что сейчас будет, не испугаешься.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000208_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000208_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:cceffa8e34c5ea0d79f0a79971e0340ed9b7a4eb1e4194f9f843c4680c5e649a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 90, "speaker": "中学時代の友人B", "translation": "Тогда давайте изучим испытания храбрости!", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000209_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000209_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8a3b6071439431f26c1072564797e53064ae90081cddbc357978d9d5a0f34d4a", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 91, "speaker": null, "translation": "Тем летом мы исследовали всевозможные испытания храбрости.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000231_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000231_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0b32d031a71932f40173a66e1d80c7fe8e308c6a8524134de0068797aa9fc213", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 92, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "…Только в школе для мальчиков от этого не было никакой пользы…", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000232_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000232_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:7df791c5691b7797a640879f3fc2bace987a4d12336a3beb16770455365b2763", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 93, "speaker": null, "translation": "Я с отрешённым видом смотрю в сторону родных краёв.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000235_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000235_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:9118929d5350fcef5248710529da91eae3e55b47f243c9774a0182ac9c28e282", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 94, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "В школе для мальчиков это бесполезно?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000236_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000236_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:e0f162e8e96b78065e94ad9fb9ff9bec4845dd11d2bb959c1e4a26c1c6bb4d70", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 95, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Нет, я о своём.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000237_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000237_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:8976b0f84e832864075fa4771a0732edf27bff2868a90ac5461e6b098a4a96b4", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 96, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "В любом случае я помогу.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000240_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000240_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6ce7c9224bafdf3131c9f2c3a092a80636885badd2a62650d6bf6ddeb0ff60d7", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 97, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Да, рассчитываю на тебя.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000243_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000243_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:60d560f01ab6a35e6cece7456d1a7263b89a720dca5cf76dcc6496ef26d9a1a5", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 98, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Уже завтра я хочу осмотреть маршрут.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000246_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000246_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:bc22a256ef6e43320644a3979dcef1ea0639583fb5bfc7d1dcf5570c27544b91", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 99, "speaker": "美希", "translation": "Составишь мне компанию?", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000247_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000247_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:512206673b437b5592fb16f97014dfd08a46ce3414fa901625bf9758fb421332", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 100, "speaker": "羽依里", "translation": "Конечно.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000248_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000248_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:0995cd2d9911a3255f420c6ba2906672fed3b56d85d55922f5f4177204523e8b", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 101, "speaker": null, "translation": "Если это даст мне больше времени с Номики, я готов на всё.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000249_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000249_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:6b004f0eebd0cc57b38792b41348db1726e55461c80daaa8c750982412dae5ee", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 102, "speaker": null, "translation": "А главное, испытание храбрости — классический способ сблизить парня и девушку, даже если мы будем работать за кулисами.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
{"id": "SEG_S0292_R000250_G00", "source_set_id": "SPRB_STEAM_LUCA", "source_id": "SRC_LUCA_E000299_R000250_G00", "source_hash": "sha256:ef2238a8cdaef936db1ccb8f84cf05e454abe8376142dd203fd2c5888f551f7f", "file_id": "S0292", "scene_id": "SCN0283", "order": 103, "speaker": null, "translation": "Теперь я с нетерпением жду завтра.", "status": "draft", "flags": []}
